---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="Experienced Toy Manufacturer from Chenghai, Guangdong since 2001. ISO, GMPC, BSCI, SEDEX certified factory.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-navy mb-6">About Kidtoy Factory</h1>
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-500 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p><strong>Experienced Toy Manufacturer from Chenghai, Guangdong. We provide professional OEM/ODM services for global brands with competitive wholesale pricing.</strong></p>
      <p>Founded in 2001, our 5,000 square meter factory in the heart of China's toy manufacturing hub has grown into a trusted partner for importers, distributors, and retailers across North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Southeast Asia.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-8">Our Certifications</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li>ISO 22716 (GMPC) - Good Manufacturing Practice for Cosmetics</li>
        <li>BSCI - Business Social Compliance Initiative</li>
        <li>SEDEX - Supplier Ethical Data Exchange</li>
        <li>GSV - Global Security Verification</li>
        <li>CE (EN71) - European Toy Safety</li>
        <li>ASTM F963 - US Toy Safety Standard</li>
        <li>CPSIA - Consumer Product Safety Improvement Act</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-8">Why Partner With Us</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li>25+ years of manufacturing experience</li>
        <li>In-house R&D and design team for OEM/ODM projects</li>
        <li>Strict quality control with third-party inspection available</li>
        <li>Competitive factory-direct pricing with no middleman markup</li>
        <li>Flexible MOQ starting from 50 pieces</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
